-- one of the two-fold rotations, through the midpoints of the bonds 0-1 and 3-4. It exchanges axial with
-- axial and equatorial with equatorial, which is what makes all six axial hydrogens one class rather than
-- two of three.
cyh-c2 : Nat → Nat
cyh-c2 = nat-xch (cons 0 (cons 2 (cons 3 (cons 6 (cons 8 (cons 9 (cons 12 (cons 14 (cons 15 nil))))))))) (cons 1 (cons 5 (cons 4 (cons 7 (cons 11 (cons 10 (cons 13 (cons 17 (cons 16 nil)))))))))
